      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不知道的事情就說不知道，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳能這樣說真不簡單。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D77E5905376844E8B60C55C318AAA4E0D77E59053FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD90196A238AAA771F4E0D7C2155AE30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳看起來不像是在裝懂，\n但因為我想說明，就讓我說吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713600100003110000FF01014F6059B3770B8D774F864E0D50CF662F572888DD61C2FF0C000A4F4656E070BA621160F38AAA660EFF0C5C318B9362118AAA542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所謂的蓋諾賽克特，\n是古生代的蟲寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n聽說牠被某個組織改造過，\n可以插上4種卡帶。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62408B02768484CB8AFE8CFD514B7279FF0C000A662F53E4751F4EE3768487F25BF653EF5922300200100001BE01000A807D8AAA726088AB67D0500B7D447E5465399020904EFF0C000A53EF4EE563D24E0A00347A2E53615E3630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我手上不知道為什麼有4個卡帶。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211624B4E0A4E0D77E5905370BA4EC09EBC67090034500B53615E3630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意的話，就試著把4個卡帶集齊吧。\n我會給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳特別的情報的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F76848A71FF0C5C318A668457628A0034500B53615E3696C69F4A54273002000A621167037D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B372795225768460C55831768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我叫<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳把4個卡帶集齊！\n可以用超級碎片交換啦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳正讓寶可夢攜帶著卡帶，\n就把它放回腰包吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3628A0034500B53615E3696C69F4AFF01000A53EF4EE575288D857D1A788E72474EA463DB5566300200100001BE01000A5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B36B638B935BF653EF5922651C5E36845753615E36FF0C000A5C31628A5B83653E56DE81705305542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳居然集齊4個卡帶了呢。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我就把珍藏的情報\n提供給如此老實的<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35C45713696C69F4A0034500B53615E364E865462300200100001BE01000A62115C31628A73CD85CF768460C55831000A63D04F9B7D6659826B6480015BE6768400100003110000FF01014F6059B3542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的手機洛托姆……\n嗶嗶嗶～地傳送可疑的資訊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D00100003110000FF01014F6059B37684624B6A5F6D1B625859C620262026000A55F655F655F6FF5E573050B3900153EF759176848CC78A0AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我把座標傳到<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的手機了。\n去那個地方看看吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
